    "text": "<p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/617d9031-049a-411c-acd4-d090bc2c1fed-2c1be671-5e2a-4a20-833d-38eadec38035-image.png\" style=\"width: 318px; height: 127px;\" /></p><p>(i)&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><msub><mi>FeCl</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>Fe</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mn>6</mn></msup><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>4</mn></math>&nbsp;unpaired electrons.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#956;</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></msqrt><mi>BM</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>4</mn><mfenced><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></msqrt><mi>BM</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>24</mn></msqrt><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>BM</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>90</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>BM</mi></math></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>(ii)&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>Co</mi><msub><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mn>3</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;a&nbsp;strong field ligand&nbsp;&amp; causes<br />pairing&nbsp;&amp; hence no. unpaired electron</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/d1612045-52d8-467e-a0ad-f00d7e398cfc-bdae788c-fb0c-4415-bbc3-8d5935175097-image.png\" style=\"width: 247px; height: 134px;\" /></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\